				{ id: "680D18F57C8DB75E", item: "grindless:creature_model_creeper", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3CDE7F33A821E1DF", item: "grindless:creature_model_blaze", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Creeper and Blaze Models"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5795EAFBAB034E45"]
			description: ["It breathes in air for the centrifuge to split into nitrogen and oxygen. Stock GregTech only lets it do that in the Overworld; here the Void and the Flatlands work too."]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_gas_collector"
			id: "09FAB2A84C90B5D6"
			rewards: [{ id: "4C62188771A6494D", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "237690F5149BA95F", item: "gtceu:lv_gas_collector", type: "item" }]
			title: "Gas Collector"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["09FAB2A84C90B5D6"]
			description: ["It pulls compounds apart with electricity and nothing else. Its big job right now is sapphire, which splits into aluminium and oxygen, and aluminium is your way into MV."]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_electrolyzer"
			id: "50622961B58725B8"
			rewards: [{ id: "1737F89DF7F3A701", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "18B27DABA1F1A8A8", item: "gtceu:lv_electrolyzer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Electrolyzer"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["50622961B58725B8"]
			description: [
				"LV's small chemistry happens here: sulfuric acid, iron chloride, and the sodium bisulfate that the electrolyzer turns into persulfate. The chloride and the persulfate both etch circuit boards."
				"The hydrogen they give off goes in a tank, not the sky. MV turns it into methanol."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_chemical_reactor"
			id: "09155B5B0F1BE994"
			rewards: [{ id: "73880280BC223A89", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5B7E3A5E7F5D45F7", item: "gtceu:lv_chemical_reactor", type: "item" }]
			title: "Chemical Reactor"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["09155B5B0F1BE994"]
			description: ["It mixes things, as advertised. Here that means drilling fluid, gallium arsenide, the roaster's catalyst and AE2's fluix crystal."]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_mixer"
			id: "3C89167418EA462B"
			rewards: [{ id: "3FE8B3BDBC000C5D", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "4BE599CF418E61FB", item: "gtceu:lv_mixer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Mixer"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3879D8323DF4F8BB"]
			description: [
				"It makes circuits in batches and takes the soldering off your hands. An LV hull and MV circuits made by hand first. Circuit lines that run without you. Boards, parts and wire by bus, circuits out by bus."
				"Its own recipe asks for the circuits it will later make, a loop you break by hand once."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_circuit_assembler"
			id: "220C6C2F1D568194"
			rewards: [{ id: "32A9BD5A41455BB9", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5899D39CB5599808", item: "gtceu:lv_circuit_assembler", type: "item" }]
			title: "Circuit Assembler"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["09155B5B0F1BE994"]
			description: [
				"A better board than the resin one, for the good circuit. Silver foil etched in sodium persulfate or iron chloride, both from your chemistry. The good electronic circuit and the circuit assembler. Etching baths on a fluid loop, boards out by bus."
				"Pick whichever etchant you have more of."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:phenolic_printed_circuit_board"
			id: "5F2D3E9A2F35D8E0"
			rewards: [{ id: "3CCE26DF092C48D3", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "45C73EBE75172899", item: "gtceu:phenolic_printed_circuit_board", type: "item" }]
			title: "Good Circuit Board"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5F2D3E9A2F35D8E0"]
			description: [
				"The mixer turns gallium and arsenic dust into gallium arsenide, and the assembler turns that into diodes. Arsenic comes out of realgar in the centrifuge, gallium out of bauxite in a persulfate bath."
				"Diodes are the last piece the MV circuit is waiting on."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:diode"
			id: "0785A341666D046E"
			rewards: [{ id: "47C80CB0BB026BC9", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "10F2763E413CF2FB", item: "gtceu:diode", type: "item" }]
			title: "Diodes"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0785A341666D046E"]
			description: [
				"The first circuit above basic, and the key to the circuit assembler. A phenolic board, diodes, and the usual wire and parts. The circuit assembler and MV machines. By hand first; the assembler takes over."
				"No MV power is needed to make it. Make a few."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:good_electronic_circuit"
			id: "3879D8323DF4F8BB"
			rewards: [{ id: "7A7D7E619B5877B2", type: "xp", xp: 45 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "01134F436F85414C", item: "gtceu:good_electronic_circuit", type: "item" }]
			title: "Good Electronic Circuit"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["220C6C2F1D568194"]
			description: ["The press stamps shaped parts out of plates. In this pack it also stamps AE2's processor presses out of steel plate, so you can skip the meteorite hunting."]
			icon: "gtceu:lv_forming_press"
			id: "2C50918B882FA400"
			rewards: [{ id: "04A087AC4B66AAE9", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
