		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0BB3182B7BA1B9AF"]
			description: ["With an interface, a pattern provider and a molecular assembler, the network starts crafting for you. They're LV hull builds too, around AE2's usual cores, and the annihilation core takes a quartzite gem where AE2 would ask for Nether quartz."]
