			title: "Electric Blast Furnace"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3822BE3A45F1C474"]
			description: [
				"The nitrogen side of the plate line: coal gas gives ammonia, and ammonia becomes nitric acid. Coal gas from a coke oven, run through the distillery and the reactor. Nitric oxide, then nitric acid. Coal gas by pipe; ammonia piped to the oxidation reactor."
				"Photographic plates start further back than you'd think."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:ammonia_bucket"
			id: "2E4A6C8B1D3F5170"
			rewards: [{ id: "4C6E8A1B3D5F7092", type: "xp", xp: 20 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "3B5D7F1A9C2E4608", item: "gtceu:ammonia_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Ammonia"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2E4A6C8B1D3F5170"]
			description: [
				"Ammonia burned over a catalyst gives nitric oxide. Ammonia and oxygen from the gas collector, in a chemical reactor. Nitrogen dioxide. Ammonia and oxygen by pipe, gas out by pipe."
				"A gas, so a tank and a pipe."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:nitric_oxide_bucket"
			id: "5D7F1B3A9C2E4806"
			rewards: [{ id: "7F1B3D5A9C2E4068", type: "xp", xp: 20 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "6E8A1C3B5D7F2094", item: "gtceu:nitric_oxide_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Nitric Oxide"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5D7F1B3A9C2E4806"]
			description: [
				"Nitric oxide takes up more oxygen and turns brown. Nitric oxide and oxygen. Nitric acid, when it meets water. Pipe both gases in; the reactor does the rest."
				"Keep it contained, it's nasty."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:nitrogen_dioxide_bucket"
			id: "1A3C5E7B9D2F4086"
			rewards: [{ id: "3C5E7A9B1D2F4068", type: "xp", xp: 20 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "2B4D6F8A1C3E5097", item: "gtceu:nitrogen_dioxide_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Nitrogen Dioxide"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1A3C5E7B9D2F4086"]
			description: [
				"The acid that dissolves silver, and later the metals of the platinum group. Nitrogen dioxide and water. Silver nitrate here, and aqua regia in MV. Keep a tank of it on the pipe network; both lines draw from it."
				"Don't store it in anything that isn't made for acid."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:nitric_acid_bucket"
			id: "4D6F8B1A3C5E7092"
			rewards: [{ id: "6F8B1D3A5C7E2094", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5E7A9C1B3D2F4086", item: "gtceu:nitric_acid_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Nitric Acid"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4D6F8B1A3C5E7092"]
			description: [
				"Silver in nitric acid becomes a salt that light can work on. Nitric acid and silver, from the galena roaster. Silver chloride. Silver by bus, acid by pipe, crystals out by bus."
				"Plain silver dust no longer makes a plate."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:silver_nitrate_dust"
			id: "7A9C1E3B5D4F2068"
			rewards: [{ id: "2D0BF2B4848716C0", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "465D741C205950BD", item: "gtceu:silver_nitrate_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Silver Nitrate"
			x: 12.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7A9C1E3B5D4F2068"]
			description: [
				"Silver nitrate and chloride swap partners, and the silver chloride drops out as a powder. Silver nitrate and a chloride, such as hydrochloric acid. The emulsion. Both by pipe and bus, powder out by bus."
				"This is the light-sensitive part of the plate."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:silver_chloride_dust"
			id: "6B8D1F3A5C7E4092"
			rewards: [{ id: "3D5F7B9A1C2E4068", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7C9E2A4B6D8F1035", item: "gtceu:silver_chloride_dust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Silver Chloride"
			x: 14.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6B8D1F3A5C7E4092"]
			description: [
				"Silver chloride held in glue, thin enough to coat glass. Silver chloride and glue, in the mixer. Photographic plates. Glue by pipe, powder by bus, emulsion by pipe to the assembler."
				"Glue comes from the same animal and plant leftovers as before."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:photographic_emulsion_bucket"
			id: "4E6A8C1B3D5F7092"
			rewards: [{ id: "6A8C1E3B5D7F2094", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5F7B9D1A3C2E4086", item: "gtceu:photographic_emulsion_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Photographic Emulsion"
			x: 16.0d
			y: -6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4E6A8C1B3D5F7092"]
			description: [
				"Glass coated with the emulsion: the film the Moon is recorded on. Glass and the emulsion, in the assembler. The optical observatory. Glass by bus, emulsion by pipe, plates out by bus."
				"Silver dust alone is gone from this recipe."
			]
			icon: "grindless:photographic_plate"
			id: "365B9E86E3AA4894"
			rewards: [{ id: "5422CC6BEE374C8F", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
