			x: 6.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2F6B1D9A8C4E0527"]
			description: [
				"It turns sunlight into steam with no fuel anywhere. A mirror field, steel casings and an open, dry sky by day. Free steam for turbines and the generator array. Steam by pipe into a tank, then to the turbines."
				"At night it does nothing at all, which is what the tank is for."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:heliostat_tower"
			id: "3A7E2C5F1B9D4061"
			rewards: [{ id: "5D5B1E3A7C42F086", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3C0F4A2E6B17D35C", item: "gtceu:heliostat_tower", type: "item" }]
			title: "Heliostat Tower"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1AC672110DFD0C14"]
			description: [
				"Up to sixteen LV generators behind one controller. A steel hall, generators, and dynamo hatches that set how many run. Compact power from steam turbines, combustion or gas turbines. One fuel input, one power output, all by pipe and cable."
				"Same fuel, same energy per bucket; you only save floor space and cable spaghetti."
